    feat(orchestrator): sum usage across tool rounds

    afterModelResponse now receives the total of every provider call in the
    turn, not only the final call. Rounds that report no usage add nothing,
    and a turn where no round reported still passes undefined.

    Re-anchors the spec link in hal-engine-tool-input-validation to the
    moved orchestrator test.

    Refs #93

